---
layout: elk
title: Life cycle of 3D model
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph C1["Creation of 3D Model"]
        A1["Idea is known"]
        A2["3D model is shaped and formed"]
        A3["Material is placed on model"]
        A4["Model is exported"]
        A1 --> A2 --> A3 --> A4
    end

    subgraph P1["Use of Python Program"]
        B1["File is plugged into the program"]
        B2["File is transferred to correct format"]
        B1 --> B2
    end

    subgraph U1["Use of 3D Model"]
        C2["Troubleshoot for any errors during transfer"]
        C3["3D model is imported"]
        C4["3D model is programmed for use"]
        C2 --> C3 --> C4
    end

    %% Flow between stages
    C1 --> P1 --> U1
    %% Feedback loop
    U1 -->|Feedback / Revisions| C1

    %% Styling
    classDef indigo stroke:#818cf8,fill:#eef2ff
    classDef teal stroke:#2dd4bf,fill:#f0fdfa
    classDef violet stroke:#a78bfa,fill:#f5f3ff
    
    class C1 indigo
    class P1 teal
    class U1 violet